# Steam Web API key — register at https://steamcommunity.com/dev/apikey
#
# ⚠️ Deliberately NOT prefixed with VITE_. Anything VITE_-prefixed is inlined into
# the browser bundle and would ship the key to every client. This name is readable
# only by the dev server (vite-plugins/steam-auth.ts) and the Rust backend.
#
# Sign-in works WITHOUT this key — OpenID returns a SteamID64 on its own. The key is
# what turns that id into a name, avatar, owned library and wishlist.
#
# Note all of those additionally require the user's Steam profile privacy to be
# Public. A private profile returns EMPTY successfully, so treat empty as
# "maybe private", never as "definitely zero".
STEAM_API_KEY=
